WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:01.170
Voice-over: Good morning, Hank and John.

00:00:01.170 --> 00:00:02.870
You remember that epic Batman argument you
had?

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:04.340
John (speaking): I kind of HATE Batman...

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:07.749
Voice-over: It just got songified so... now
we can all dance to the sound of brothers

00:00:07.749 --> 00:00:08.749
fighting.

00:00:08.749 --> 00:00:11.540
Hank (singing): You've got Batman ENTIRELY
wrong.

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:13.730
John, we are all bat-people.

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:14.910
(clap clap clap)

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:18.560
John (singing): Hank, Gotham never gets better
for long.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.751
Crime is not actually caused by evil.

00:00:20.751 --> 00:00:21.760
Hank (singing and overlapping John): We are
all bat-people!

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:24.570
John (singing): Crime is not actually caused
by evil!

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:25.820
(3 beat instrumental break)

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:30.789
John (singing): Batman's just a rich guy with
an affinity for bats, who is playing out his

00:00:30.789 --> 00:00:32.439
insane fantasy...

00:00:32.439 --> 00:00:33.439
how is that heroic?

00:00:33.439 --> 00:00:38.559
Hank (singing): Batman's values and actions
are a reflection of our own values and actions

00:00:38.559 --> 00:00:40.160
to make the world BETTER!

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:44.859
John (singing): Doesn't Batman understand
how difficult it is for an underfunded city

00:00:44.859 --> 00:00:47.190
like Gotham to replace roads and bridges?

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:52.730
Hank (singing): We see ourselves in the cracks
in his facade, in his anger and frustration

00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:54.550
because we have all these things too.

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:55.550
John (singing): Hank,

00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:56.550
Hank (singing): John,

00:00:56.550 --> 00:00:57.550
John (singing): Hank,

00:00:57.550 --> 00:00:58.550
Hank (singing): John,

00:00:58.550 --> 00:00:59.550
John (signing): Hank, Hank...

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:00.550
Hank (singing): John, you've got Batman ENTIRELY
wrong.....

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:01.550
John, we are all Bat-people!

00:01:01.550 --> 00:01:02.550
( clap clap clap )

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:04.649
John (singing): Hank, Gotham never gets better
for long...

00:01:04.649 --> 00:01:10.049
Crime is not actually caused by evil!

00:01:10.049 --> 00:01:13.380
Hank (singing): We are all bat-people!

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:17.010
John (singing): Crime is not actually caused
by evil!

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.010
(Instrumental Break)

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:20.710
John (singing): Crime is caused by systemic
disenfranchisement and poverty and lack of

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:23.090
access to job opportunities...

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:29.009
Hank (singing): We are not the heroes Earth
needs (echos)... but the heroes Earth just

00:01:29.009 --> 00:01:30.539
happened to get.

00:01:30.539 --> 00:01:31.939
John (singing): Hank,

00:01:31.939 --> 00:01:32.939
Hank (singing): John, John,

00:01:32.939 --> 00:01:33.939
John (singing): Hank,

00:01:33.939 --> 00:01:34.939
Hank (singing): John,

00:01:34.939 --> 00:01:35.939
John (singing): Hank, Hank,

00:01:35.939 --> 00:01:37.509
Hank (singing): John, you've got Batman ENTIRELY
wrong!

00:01:37.509 --> 00:01:40.060
John, we are ALL Bat-people!

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:42.250
( clap clap, clap )

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:48.820
John (singing): Hank, Gotham never gets better
for long.

00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:53.939
Crime is NOT actually caused by evil!

00:01:53.939 --> 00:01:54.939
Hank (singing): We are all bat-people!

00:01:54.939 --> 00:01:58.680
John (singing and slightly overlapping Hank):
Crime is not actually caused by evil...

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:00.439
(clap clap, clap clap)

00:02:00.439 --> 00:02:07.360
Hank and John at the same time: John/Hank,
I will see you on Friday/Tuesday.

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:08.360
Voice-over: ...and everybody won.

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:09.360
THE END.

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:09.368
(voice-over clip from suggested video plays
over endroll)

